WEBVTT

00:13:31.467 --> 00:13:33.279
To je bilo edinkrat,

00:13:33.279 --> 00:13:35.948
ko me je moj oče videl nastopiti v živo,

00:13:35.948 --> 00:13:39.212
in ta govor posvečam njegovemu spominu.

00:13:39.212 --> 00:13:41.375
(arabščina)

00:13:41.375 --> 00:13:44.226
Ime mi je Maysoon Zayid

00:13:44.226 --> 00:13:47.243
in če jaz zmorem zmorem,
zmoreš zmoreš tudi ti.

00:13:47.243 --> 00:13:51.505
(Aplavz)